{"id":"9728b42de85725ba","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-bounded-change-set.md","title":"可计算有界变化集","display":"df-bounded-change-set — 可计算有界变化集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-bounded-change-set","aliases":["43-df-bounded-change-set"],"display":"df-bounded-change-set — 可计算有界变化集","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-ce-set]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: 原目录误名；所供2007稿未给此名称","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-bounded-change-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-bounded-change-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-change-set — 可计算有界变化集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5ffc25900e8348f\" href=\"?note=d5ffc25900e8348f\" title=\"43-df-omega-ce-set\">43-df-omega-ce-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: 原目录误名；所供2007稿未给此名称"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5ffc25900e8348f\" href=\"?note=d5ffc25900e8348f\" title=\"43-df-omega-ce-set\">43-df-omega-ce-set</a>。下式定义自然数集合上的谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该节点原有数学内容是可计算地有界变化的集合性质。现用相应的谓词和文件名表示，并继续依赖已有的 omega-c.e. 集定义；没有把它改成新的 Turing 度性质，也没有另增 Demuth 随机度定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"d5ffc25900e8348f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"d5ffc25900e8348f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\omega\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-ce-set]]。下式定义自然数集合上的谓词 $\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1078,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-529","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-bounded-change-set]] — 有界变化集"}],"outgoing":["d5ffc25900e8348f"]}